<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
    <title>Links - Die When You Die 2026</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, Segoe UI, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial;
            line-height: 1.6;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            background: #111;
            color: #eee
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 900px;
            margin: 48px auto;
            padding: 24px
        }

        a {
            color: #7bd389
        }

        header h1 {
            margin: 0 0 8px;
            font-size: 28px
        }

        .card {
            background: #0e0e0e;
            border: 1px solid #1a1a1a;
            padding: 16px;
            border-radius: 8px
        }

        ul.links {
            list-style: none;
            padding: 0;
            margin: 0
        }

        ul.links li {
            padding: 12px 0;
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03)
        }

        ul.links li:last-child {
            border-bottom: 0
        }

        .meta {
            color: #999;
            font-size: 13px
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>
    <div class="container">
        <header>
            <h1>Are you wondering what to expect?</h1>
            <p class="meta">Get Busy Dying</p>
        </header>

        <section class="card" aria-labelledby="links-heading">
            <h2 id="links-heading" style="margin-top:0;font-size:18px;color:#ddd">Everything is pointless. Life is
                meaningless. Don't you know that by now?</h2>
            <ul class="links">
                <li>
                    <a href="/" rel="internal">Home</a>
                    <div class="meta">Main site index</div>
                </li>
                <li>
                    <a href="https://2025.DieWhenYouDie.org/">2025 DieWhenYouDie</a>
                    <div class="meta">2025 Site</div>
                </li>
                <li>
                    <a href="https://2024.DieWhenYouDie.org/">2024 DieWhenYouDie</a>
                    <div class="meta">2024 Site</div>
                </li>
            </ul>
        </section>


        <section class="card" aria-labelledby="links-heading">
            <h2 id="links-heading" style="margin-top:0;font-size:18px;color:#ddd">More Useless Information</h2>
            <ul class="links">
                <li>
                    <a href="/agenda" rel="internal">Agenda</a>
                    <div class="meta">Coming Soon</div>
                </li>
                <li>
                    <a href="https://2024.diewhenyoudie.org/#FAQ">Frequently Asked Questions</a>
                    <div class="meta">What the Fuck is this?</div>
                </li>
                <li>
                    <a href="/poem">Sample Poem</a>
                    <div class="meta">....just some poetry</div>
                </li>
            </ul>
        </section>


    </div>
</body>

</html>